 "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15624, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0149m24nW9CpnP32pcGkk4dp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18407, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01DtmLD3Dbt36tZkfpHUVWeK", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. Actions taken: rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, across us-east, us-west and eu-west. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A retry completed the rollout to v2.3.0 in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure before re-attempting v2.3.1. v2.3.1-rc is also marked unhealthy in staging.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025-incident-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49007, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01DtmLD3Dbt36tZkfpHUVWeK", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025-incident-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49007, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DtmLD3Dbt36tZkfpHUVWeK", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 50336, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MoEVGdiiPg7kriC8h866N4", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50636, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MoEVGdiiPg7kriC8h866N4", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50636, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MoEVGdiiPg7kriC8h866N4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52989, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is healthy again on v2.3.0 in all three regions, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc is only in staging. Because v2.3.0 had already run healthily in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed. I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident request timed out, but the incident was created. I checked the incident list before retrying, so there is one incident, INC-0001, with the rollback details and the partial failure in its summary.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout. v2.3.1 should not be re-deployed until that is understood.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UKVg7YTzk9RSTEFgK3cdS8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XfiasPZuT3xfVQZZyVzBuQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "ge