s only in staging. Because v2.3.0 had already run healthily in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed. I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident request timed out, but the incident was created. I checked the incident list before retrying, so there is one incident, INC-0001, with the rollback details and the partial failure in its summary.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout. v2.3.1 should not be re-deployed until that is understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}